WEBVTT

00:06:27.135 --> 00:06:30.046
if they can break a few norms

00:06:30.046 --> 00:06:34.650
of family and society,

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:40.130
if they can abolish the discriminatory laws

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.658
of the systems in their states,

00:06:42.658 --> 00:06:44.949
which go against the basic human rights

00:06:44.949 --> 00:06:48.743
of the women.

00:06:48.743 --> 00:06:53.987
Dear brothers and sisters, when Malala was born,

00:06:53.987 --> 00:06:56.140
and for the first time,

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.414
believe me,

00:06:57.414 --> 00:07:02.391
I don't like newborn children, to be honest,